                                            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-weight="700">Note:</fo:block>
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The On/Off
                                                Switch and optional System Shutdown Switch both act
                                                as Rapid Shutdown (RSD) initiators. These switches
                                                are used by emergency responders to trigger rapid
                                                shutdown of the solar array in the event of an
                                                emergency.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
